WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.434 line:92%
-So, last time you were here,

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.669 size:78% position:39%
we were talking about
your show "Revenge."

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:05.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I feel like, in this show,
it's safe to say,

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
you are actually
playing a character

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.441 size:88% position:44% line:92%
who has a moral compass.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:09.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, she has a moral compass.
Thank God.

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:12.912
-Do you enjoy that? Do you enjoy
playing a person who's kinder?

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:15.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She's still tough,
but it's nice

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she has, as you say,
a moral compass.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
She's got a tremendous amount
of integrity.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just, like,
was really drawn to that

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
after four years
of playing this nut.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know?
-Yes.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's nice to get out of
the nut game.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, of course.
-You need a little break.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Diversify, yeah.
-Exactly.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.498 line:92%
-Did you spend time with people

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:33.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the medical profession
to prepare for this?

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:34.934 line:92%
-Yeah. I mean, you have to.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.670
You can't really shadow because
it's strange, you know?

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:40.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wouldn't want that.
-I would not want my doctor

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.341 line:92%
to come in and be like --

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:44.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Here's actress Emily VanCamp.
She's shadowing me today."

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:44.944 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's strange.

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:48.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I spoke to nurses and
nurse practitioners at length

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, you know,
mostly just wanted

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:53.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
to get to know what a day
looks like for them.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:55.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, when do you cry
as a nurse?

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:56.556 line:92%
You know, like, when do you --

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:58.925 size:88% position:44%
All of the little things
you don't think about.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:00:59.359 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Sure.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:01.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it was just
a fascinating process.

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:03.563 line:92%
And, gosh, do I have -- Oh, hey.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:04.664 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Rookie mistake.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:10.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I mean, I just --
I found them fascinating.

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:14.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have so much respect
for medical professionals,

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:15.475 line:92%
not that I didn't before.

00:01:15.475 --> 00:01:17.277 line:92%
But, my God, they're noble.

00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:18.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it true that
you've been watching

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
YouTube videos
of gruesome surgeries?

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.516 line:92%
-Dude. [ Chuckles ] It's rough.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, well, what's rough
is now YouTube's gonna start

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:28.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
suggesting other things
for you to watch.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:29.823 line:92%
-I know. No. It already does.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:31.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
Things pop up,
and I'm like, "Oh, God!"

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:35.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, but I am a little bit
less squeamish now.

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:37.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's weird.
Like, I was sort of just

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
kind of doing some research
the other night.

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:40.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have this procedure
we have to do

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:45.605
which is cutting into an eyelid
and then an eyeball.

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:48.141 line:92%
And I just found myself --

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:48.708 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm serious.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.444
I found myself just, like,
nonchalantly watching it.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
Our nurse who helps us out
sent it over,

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm just, like,
watching this procedure,

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:57.851 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I realized, "Oh, my God.
I'm just doing this."

00:01:57.851 --> 00:01:58.518 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:00.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I'm just doing it,
and I've got no feeling."

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.790
I was numb to it. It's amazing.
So I don't know.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.125 line:92%
Maybe I'm just indirectly --

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:06.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you either
are getting better

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:08.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
or you've turned into
a sociopath.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:09.429 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-That too. So...

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:12.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Does your mom have trouble
watching the show?

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:12.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She does.
-Okay.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:15.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Most of my family,
except my sister
who's studying to be a vet.

00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:16.803 line:92%
She's like, "I got this."

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:19.906
But, you know, we all kind of
think we have all the ailments.

00:02:19.906 --> 00:02:21.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I see.
-So every script I read,

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:22.842 line:92%
I'm like, "Oh, my God, Mom!

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:25.078
I'm pretty sure I have this,
I'm pretty sure I have that!"

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:27.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she's like,
"I have that, too!"

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:30.216 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Thanks. That's helpful.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:36.422
But, yeah, it's definitely been
a test for me to do this show.

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:39.359
And I'm learning a huge amount,
which is kind of cool.

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:41.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know you and your family
are huge hockey fans.

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
You are shooting in Atlanta
right now.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:44.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No hockey team.
They have a soccer team,

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:47.233
but they can't have --
They used to have a hockey team.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:48.635 line:92%
-Yeah, they used to have one.

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, is it hard for you --
What is your team?

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The Canadiens.
-The Canadiens. Gotcha.

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:53.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
-'Cause I studied in Montreal.
-Gotcha.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But they're huge rivals
with Toronto,

00:02:55.275 --> 00:02:57.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, you know,
I'm from Toronto, so, yeah.

00:02:57.477 --> 00:03:00.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I get, like, hate mail
from my family constantly.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
Well, still, it's nice of them

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:04.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
to write a letter
in this day and age.

00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:08.621
Yeah, exactly. Exactly.
And it's, like, very
Canadian-style hate mail.

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it's like, you know --
It's not too bad.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.692
-It's like, "You're going down.
Also, I hope you're well."

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:15.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, exactly. Yes.
Exactly. Exactly.

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:18.731 line:92%
Also, "Can't wait to see you."

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:20.066 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-So, hard to keep up?

00:03:20.066 --> 00:03:23.269
-It is because I don't have
actual television in Atlanta.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:26.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just have streaming.
So I'm always --

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:27.006 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
My mom updates me

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:28.975 size:84% position:42%
'cause she's actually a
Canadiens fan, as well.

00:03:28.975 --> 00:03:30.443
-Gotcha.
-So things get a little heated.

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:33.479
-Well, it's nice that you can
stay a family unit despite this.

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:34.113 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Exactly. Exactly.

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:37.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We did not talk about
this last time you were
here because you --

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:39.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not sure,
but you have certainly been

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:41.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
in a "Captain America" movie
since you've been here.

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:42.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I don't think
I was in --

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:45.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How is -- And here's a photo.
You are in this photo.

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:48.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am somewhere.
I'm like on the end somewhere.

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:50.129 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There I think I am.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:51.497 line:92%
-This is the Marvel class photo

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:54.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
of everybody who's been
in a Marvel film,

00:03:54.534 --> 00:03:56.869 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's an incredible
group of people.

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:58.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
How has the experience
been for you?

00:03:58.371 --> 00:04:01.641 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's been amazing.
I mean, everyone's incredible.

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:02.875 line:92%
The movies are so amazing,

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:05.545 size:84% position:42%
so it's just incredible
to be a part of them.

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:09.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then being on that stage
was just weird.

00:04:09.048 --> 00:04:11.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"What am I doing here?"

00:04:11.317 --> 00:04:14.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, who said to call
Emily VanCamp?

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:15.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I'm like,
"This is crazy."

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:17.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was so fascinating.
-It's a weird thing because --

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:21.427
That's like more famous people
than are at any given Oscars.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:23.196 line:92%
-It's so many famous people

00:04:23.196 --> 00:04:25.164 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so many people
that I respect and love.

00:04:25.164 --> 00:04:28.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just kind of was just
sort of standing there in awe.

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:30.103 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was very cool.

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:31.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
And those movies
are just awesome.

00:04:31.371 --> 00:04:33.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They're great. I know there's
a high level of secrecy

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:35.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you work on a film
like that, but is there --

00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:38.344
-I have like, a silent drone
following me around right now.

00:04:38.344 --> 00:04:41.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Are you allowed
to take souvenirs

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:42.282 size:88% position:44% line:92%
from the set at the end?

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:45.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, not me.
And I wouldn't even try.

00:04:45.685 --> 00:04:46.419 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I mean, that's scary.

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:49.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Or take, like, a really
low-level prop, like a pencil.

00:04:49.289 --> 00:04:50.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, I probably
could take a pencil,

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:55.328
but even then, somebody would be
like -- They know everything.

00:04:55.328 --> 00:04:59.432 size:84% position:42%
No, but it's -- Yeah --
I didn't even attempt.

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:00.066 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Gotcha.

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:01.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was just really happy
to be there,

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.303 size:78% position:39%
and I did not want to
ruffle any feathers.

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:04.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very smart. Very smart.
Wait, like, 'til

00:05:04.504 --> 00:05:06.939
your third or fourth movie
and then steal something.

00:05:06.939 --> 00:05:07.940 line:92%
-Yeah, yeah, yeah. Exactly.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Steal the shield
and get out of there.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know you're also
a poker player.

00:05:13.179 --> 00:05:14.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is something --
-I am, yeah.

00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:17.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And when did your love
of poker start?

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:18.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I started young.
I started as a teenager.

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:22.055
-Okay, that's good. I think most
poker players probably did.

00:05:22.055 --> 00:05:24.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Back when I was doing
"Everwood,"

00:05:24.157 --> 00:05:27.126
that's what we would do because
we were shooting in Utah,

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:28.227 line:92%
and I just fell in love with it.

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:30.063
I mean, I don't play in casinos
or the games or anything.

00:05:30.063 --> 00:05:32.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I feel like Utah would be
heartbroken to find out

00:05:32.498 --> 00:05:34.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
that because you were there
you became a gambler.

00:05:34.701 --> 00:05:36.969 size:88% position:44%
-I think there are oddly
a lot of gamblers there.

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:38.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, that makes sense.
That tracks, yeah.

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:40.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But, yeah, I love it.
It's a great game.

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:42.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's what I do
with my friends.

00:05:42.442 --> 00:05:43.343 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, we just...
-Gotcha.

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:45.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...get around a poker table,
and it's good fun.

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:47.013 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you think
you could actually beat --

00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:48.781 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, take down
some professionals?

00:05:48.781 --> 00:05:51.684 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you at that level?
-I've never tried.

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:52.485 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-I feel like this is --

00:05:52.485 --> 00:05:53.886
I feel like you're playing coy,
but you could.

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:56.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're like, "I don't know.
I'd love to play,
though, gentlemen."

00:05:56.656 --> 00:05:58.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm just joining
the World Poker Tour.

00:05:58.558 --> 00:06:00.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I don't know
if I'm at that level,

00:06:00.426 --> 00:06:02.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I've been playing
for a long time.

00:06:02.362 --> 00:06:03.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right.
You never know then.

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:05.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, thanks so much
for being back.

00:06:05.598 --> 00:06:08.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's such a pleasure
to see you again.

